node_modules/
dist/
.vercel/
.DS_Store
*.log
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# The preview deploy's baked-in server address — public by definition, and it
# must ship with the upload folder or Vercel builds the offline demo instead.
!upload/zinc/.env.production

# Server state: the ledger and the house hot wallet. Never committed.
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
house-keypair.json

# Raw art masters. ~36 MB of green-screen generator output that was already
# chroma-keyed and packed into apps/web/public — nothing here ships, and none
# of it will ever change. The RECIPE is committed (art-drop/README.md has the
# exact prompts), so the art is reproducible without carrying the originals in
# every clone. Keep the folder itself backed up somewhere: it is the only copy
# of the masters if anyone ever wants to re-crop or add a character.
art-drop/**/*.jpg
art-drop/**/*.png

# Python bytecode from the art pipeline
__pycache__/
*.pyc
